# Lease TTL.
#
# This is the whole fail-closed guarantee: no new lease means no new payment, so
# killing the core stops spending within this window. Shorter is stronger.
#
# It also has to survive a real settlement. PolicyModule reverts LeaseExpired
# when block.timestamp > req.leaseExpiry, and the lease is issued BEFORE the
# request, the ceremony and the Base Sepolia broadcast — a full dispatch measures
# ~5s end to end, so the 5000 this used to be left roughly zero headroom and one
# slow block reverted the payment. 15s keeps the guarantee meaningful and the
# demo reproducible. Lower it only against a chain with faster inclusion.
LEASE_TTL_MS=15000
